  "question": {
    "text": "$2.8 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{~mol}$ of $\\mathrm{CO}_2$ is left after removing $10^{21}$ molecules from its ' $x$ ' mg sample. The mass of $\\mathrm{CO}_2$ taken initially is\nGiven: $\\mathrm{N}_{\\mathrm{A}}=6.02 \\times 10^{23} \\mathrm{~mol}^{-1}$",
